      "comment": "FERNDALE FLYER (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 27.57 beating Cypher Monelli. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Will go close again if runs up to latest. LIGHTNING BYTE (8) collided in the run but boxed on to place when a 4 length second in fast time (27.81) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Harder here but expected to measure up. ALL ABOUT COAL (3) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at Cannington over 601m behind West On Menace (35.63) in a Grade 5. Better than last start and can bounce back. SMELL LIKE ROSE (4) has been in the frame at her last two runs, most recently when third (28.13) in a Grade 5 over 488m at this track.",
